    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71434" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξανθίζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξανθός</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make yellow</i> or
				<i>brown,</i> by roasting or frying, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				1047
			</span></i>, cj. in <i><span class="en">
				Philem.
				79.6
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξανθισμέναι</span>”
				<i>with hair dyed yellow,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					43
				</span></i>
			 (
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξηνθισμέναι</span>
			), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				289
			</span></i> ; dub. in <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				7.9
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν τρίχα -όμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Duris
					10
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr., <i>to be yellow,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Le.</u>
				13.30
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίχεσ-ουσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					5.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
